vernments requiring it texas south  dakota  idaho you know all these florida all  these different states are signing  different things  banning required vaccination but it only  applies to government and some  very narrow other situations so you are  starting to see  the posts are all over the internet  they're all over my twitter every time i  tweet about vaccines they're all in the  comments every time you read about  oh uh this university will require  vaccination that one will for on campus  students people commenting and saying  this is illegal the governor already  banned it  this was written on the wall go back to  my commentary from when we talked about  arizona issuing a ban on vaccine  requirements  and i said you were going to have these  anti-vaxx people showing up  saying you can't do this because the  governor banned it and of course the  governor's orders  do not apply to colleges and  universities  and you know ticketmaster and live  nation or  if the phoenix suns in arizona their bat  the basketball team wants to say to come  to  to games you have to have proof of  vaccination or they might say you need  proof of vaccination or you've got to  take a negative test  if you're not vaccinated these are two  different things and we knew that they  were going to start confusing them  either deliberately  or be because they don't actually  understand  the limits of what government can and  cannot decree here one thing has nothing  to do with the other  it was predictable that it would create  chaos  and we're not even at the point where  kids are starting to go back to school  yet  by the time that fall comes we hopefully  will be  closer to herd immunity there are  concerns as to whether we will ever get  there  but we we will we should be closer if  not actually there i think we will be  doing very well as far as cases and  deaths go by that point in time  everybody who wants a vaccine by far  will have been able to get one we're  getting close to that and now it's about  convincing people  to want to get the vaccine way more  colleges and universities and maybe  airlines and maybe other venues and  businesses and on and on  hospitals whatever will have said in  order to work here  in order to attend school here in order  to patronize our services that we offer  you will need to have proof of  vaccination and they are going to be  going absolutely nuts how does this get  solved i have no idea  i have no idea the the level of  misunderstanding  and it's predictable listen it's true  that  even people who aren't particularly  ignorant if you don't follow this stuff  closely and you hear  you know arizona arizona governor bans  mandatory vaccines  and meanwhile arizona state university  says you've got to be vaccinated to come  to campus  that does sound like a conflict in some  sense and it requires  understanding that what the arizona  governor passed applies only to  a city can't require being vaccinated to  go to the dmv or deny you  dmv services that type of thing it does  not apply to arizona arizona state  university or whatever else  it was completely predictable it's going  to be absolute chaos and i think there  is going to be  probably as travel starts to open in  other countries there are already other  countries that are leaning in the  direction of saying  if american travelers if any travelers  want to come here you will need to be  vaccinated  this is likely to reach a fever pitch in  july into august and as we get close to  the fall semester  there's going to be protests there's  going to be absolute and total chaos and  it was completely  predictable all along one of our  sponsors is privacy.com they're giving  you five dollars when you sign up for  their completely  free service at privacy.com pacman i've  been using privacy for a little over a  year now you've heard me talk about it  before  it's a lifesaver and here's how it works  takes just a couple of minutes to set up  anytime you buy  somethi